<!--
  RUT_ScarlandsFlora.xml                 UtinniPatches - COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1

  Resolves ledger slug
  `the_scarlands:the-glowers-black-radiotrophic-crust-flora-crater-bowl-varni`
  (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_scarlands.md §4: "The Glowers —
  black-hued mosses and lichens along the ground, eating the radiation itself
  ... glassy dark varnish painting crater bowls and hotspots, thickening for
