  rosters/the_scarlands.json, mechanic_load "none blocking for the def;
  glower-fuel harvest rides SCARLANDS_MECHANICS_1"). RUT_Scarlands.xml's own
  header already flags this exact gap: "SS4's only flora are the Glowers
