  own call)" — this file is that landing.

  🔑 The name is NOT provisional here. "The Glowers" is the owner's own
  proper noun, used capitalized in the sheet's own prose (§4/§7) — same
  "owner's own name stands" posture as the arid_shrubland sheet's
  Ultracactus (COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1 wave 1). No naming card filed for
  this def.

  Checked first (per this item's own "watch out"): infrastructure/artpipe/
  {done,pending,registry.jsonl} for "glower"/"mortuary" — clean, nothing
  exists. No open item names this slug (grepped infrastructure/state/items/
  for "glower"). RUT_Scarlands.xml is NOT migrated to a standalone mod
  (unlike RUT_Greentide.xml/RUT_WeepingStones.xml, the only two BiomeDefs in
