  varnish, not an upright plant) so this def copies that shape: PlantBase,
  non-selectable, no wind exposure, low fertility requirement (crater floors
  and hotspots, not soil). ban 3 ("No green — the flora palette is black,
  glass and rust") is met directly: Beauty left at 0 (not a decorative
  plant), no green-toned art, description matches the sheet's own "glassy
