  Harvest: harvestedThingDef points at RUT_GlowerCrust (RUT_ScarlandsItems.xml,
  same file family posture as RUT_Vorrel/RUT_VorrelFruit) — a plain raw
  resource landing now. The bespoke "glower-fuel harvest" GAMEPLAY LOOP
  (radiation-dose-vs-yield tradeoff the roster's own mechanic_load names) is
  real C# still owed to SCARLANDS_MECHANICS_2 (the live successor to the
  closed SCARLANDS_MECHANICS_1 spec) — same "def lands first, behaviour
  comp follows" precedent DESERT_SHADE_WHALE_FILTERFEED_1/
  SHRUBLAND_GIANT_ENRAGE_1 already used this item. Not filed as a fresh item
  here: SCARLANDS_MECHANICS_2 already exists, is open, and its own spec text
